   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Help on the Way**: cut on the recording [2]\n- **Help on the Way/banter (multiple takes)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **gd1975-06-05.145778.sbd.pcm.dalton.miller.noel.flac16** (recommended): soundboard; 6 songs; 47 min [1]. Said about its sound: Track 5 fades near 1:30, then has a cut at 4:29; the amount of missing material is unknown [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Franklin's Tower [1]\n- Material is rehearsal work on Help on the Way, Slipknot, Franklin's Tower, and Stronger Than Dirt, with notes placing it at Ace's [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **gd1975-06-05.145778.sbd.pcm.dalton.miller.noel.flac16**: taped by Tim Dalton; transferred by Joe Noel and Charlie Miller; source: Soundboard -> ? -> PCM [1]",
